# electron-vite's build output (11-electron.md §3) — this repo's root .gitignore
# knows `dist/`, which is every other package's convention but not this one.
#
# Scoped to this package rather than added at the root on purpose: an unanchored
# `out/` there would also match any source directory named `out`, which is the
# same trap the root file already documents for `data/` (it once hid
# apps/server/src/routes/data/ from version control).
out/

# Generated by 11-T13's icon script from the 02-design-system.md master; only the
# master is checked in.
resources/icons/*.png
resources/icons/*.icns
resources/icons/*.ico

# Generated at build by 11-T18's scripts/generate-notices.mjs; never hand-edited.
# THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt is the generated attribution file; LICENSE is a copy of
# the repo LICENSE staged next to it for §13's in-app viewer (one source of truth).
resources/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
resources/LICENSE
